/-!
# Characteristic-two component preliminaries

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*,
16.1.2–16.1.6, printed pp.1170–1172.

The exports identify the source center/core quotients, project the actual
fixed two-residuals, prove the PSL₂ and Suzuki innerness cases of 16.1.6,
and identify the fixed subgroup of the binary PSL₂ quotient's outer
involutions, their actual field action, and their two-residuals with the
small derived endpoint retained. The linear-three exports add all-exponent
Sylow fixation and long-root coordinates, the field/graph residual rows,
and the larger unitary residuals. The full linear-three table still requires
the explicit degree-two graph-field marking. The Lie-family multiplier
restrictions and the other families'
automorphism and root-centralizer cases, and the exceptional residual
lifting calculations remain required for the full source assertions.
-/
